  ('su-40-thunderspear', 'Sensor Turret', 45, 'Main turret. Small target: Called Shot only, -3 to strike. Destroying it cuts long-range communication and every optical and sensory aid; the pilot loses the bonuses his piloting skill and the vehicle''s features give.', 7),
  ('su-40-thunderspear', 'Top Access Hatch', 80, 'Main turret. Low profile: it can be targeted only by an enemy right on top of it.', 8),
